<speak>
<s>This is your Jumu'ah briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">24072026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>The world's leading hunger monitor projects that two-thirds of Gaza will face acute hunger by December, even as aid volumes fall again.</s> <s>Child malnutrition eased after the twenty twenty-five ceasefire let food in, but the Integrated Food Security Phase Classification says those gains are already reversing.</s> <s>Israel's military-run aid body calls the finding biased... yet the deprivation is now baked into a population whose food system was destroyed, not merely interrupted.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Ukraine recorded seventy-three thousand births against nearly two hundred sixty thousand deaths in the first half of this year, a ratio approaching four deaths for every birth.</s> <s>The country's own justice ministry logged the figures, and in the front-line Donetsk region just one hundred thirty-four babies were born in six months.</s> <s>This is demographic irreversibility — a wartime birth collapse and millions of refugees who won't return compound with every year the fighting drags on.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In Hong Kong, independent bookstores are closing shelf by shelf, squeezed not by arrests but by licensing pressure, landlord harassment, and inspections under the National Security Law.</s> <s>These shops are among the last visible remnants of the city's open civil society.</s> <s>Authoritarian consolidation now runs through quiet administrative friction rather than spectacle — harder to protest, and easier to deny.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Floods across thirteen Indian districts have killed forty-seven people, with seventy to eighty still missing in Sivasagar and Charaideo.</s> <s>More than seven hundred twenty thousand people are affected as upstream monsoon rain again drowns the Brahmaputra plains.</s> <s>This isn't a freak disaster but an annual cycle, worsening as monsoons intensify while embankment repair stays chronically underfunded.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A gunman in Manta killed prosecutor Alexandra Bravo and her sister; she was Ecuador's twenty-sixth slain justice official since twenty twenty.</s> <s>Bravo had been investigating United States strikes on three Ecuadorian boats and survivors' accounts of torture.</s> <s>Accountability for foreign lethal operations depends entirely on host-state prosecutors — a single point of failure that has now been removed.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>The United States Senate killed a measure to curb the president's war powers over Iran, forty-nine votes to forty-seven.</s> <s>The House had passed it hours earlier, continuing months of symbolic votes that have never once stopped a night of strikes.</s> <s>Iran keeps hitting American bases as nightly airstrikes continue, and Congress has shown it will not intervene.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Sindh's provincial leaders have condemned federal water diversions into the new Jalalpur Canal as unconstitutional.</s> <s>Pakistan's interprovincial allocation is a zero-sum contest between upstream Punjab and downstream Sindh, governed by a nineteen ninety-one accord no one can enforce.</s> <s>For Sindhi farmers at the tail end of the Indus, every new canal reads as a transfer of their livelihood upstream.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Riyadh has signed a deal with Washington to enrich its own reactor fuel, alongside a separate pact opening new uranium exports from Australia.</s> <s>Enrichment is the same technology that turns a civilian program into a weapons question, which is why fuel access has long been the sticking point.</s> <s>Neither Washington nor Westinghouse has said where the seventeen and a half billion dollars in reactors will actually be built.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Brazilian prosecutors froze roughly one and a half million dollars per suspect this week in Operation Janus, arresting nearly twenty people tied to the First Capital Command.</s> <s>The country's largest crime syndicate has vertically integrated into oil distribution, fintech, and even influencer marketing.</s> <s>You can seize assets far faster than you can dismantle the market position that keeps producing them.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>South Africa's central bank held interest rates, but two of its six policymakers wanted a hike as oil rebounded to ninety dollars a barrel.</s> <s>Volatility around the Strait of Hormuz is keeping inflation above the bank's three percent target well into next year.</s> <s>A distant war in the Gulf now sets the price of bread in Pretoria.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>An Australia-Thailand research team is restoring lost seagrass meadows with pods printed in three dimensions from biodegradable bioplastic, which anchor seedlings until they root, then dissolve.</s> <s>Seagrass sequesters carbon faster per hectare than rainforest and nurses coastal fisheries, yet it's been vanishing worldwide.</s> <s>Restoration's hardest problem was never the seeds but survival through the first few weeks, which the dissolving pod finally solves.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Researchers in London have found a twenty-five-protein signature in blood serum that tracks cellular aging.</s> <s>When they bathed skin cells in serum drawn across the adult lifespan, mitochondrial energy output fell as the donor's biological age rose.</s> <s>This early-access finding points toward a measurable marker of biological rather than chronological age — the substrate for treatments that target what circulates in the blood.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Two rigorous methods for measuring how fast the universe expands stubbornly disagree, and Nobel laureate Adam Riess now calls the mismatch a cosmological crisis.</s> <s>Either one measurement is subtly wrong, or the standard model of cosmology itself is incomplete.</s> <s>Neither side has found the flaw, and the discrepancy has only sharpened as the instruments have improved.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>American startup founders are lobbying their own government not to restrict Chinese open-weight AI models, the free, downloadable systems that much of the US research ecosystem now builds on.</s> <s>Once weights are released, they can't be un-shared, so a national-security block would cut off domestic developers rather than Beijing's labs.</s> <s>Open-source AI has quietly become geopolitical infrastructure.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A Kremlin-linked group known as Laundry Bear exploited a zero-click flaw to break into Zimbra webmail systems worldwide, the United States and its allies warned.</s> <s>A zero-click bug needs no mistake from the victim; the intrusion happens silently, with nothing ever clicked.</s> <s>The advisory names no confirmed victims and discloses no patch timeline, leaving administrators exposed.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>